<title>USA: Mid-American Waste says bankruptcy court oks sale.</title>
<headline>Mid-American Waste says bankruptcy court oks sale.</headline>
<dateline>CANAL WINCHESTER, Ohio 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mid-American Waste Sytems Inc said Tuesday that the U.S. Bankruptcy Court in Delaware has approved the previously disclosed sales of substantially all of its assets to USA Waste Services Inc.</p>
<p>The company said that following consummation of the sale, which is expected to occur promptly, it expects to file a reorganization plan that would provide for the distribution of the proceeds to creditors.</p>
<p>Equity holders, said Mid-American, would expect to receive minimal value under any such plan.</p>
</text>
